Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 03:45:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Preserve nested shell contexts in lifecycle comment
 scanning

Proof: four original RUN rows fail on ac1098e9cb after real Bash markers; clean twins pass. Expanded suite passes 30 cases, and all 23 lifecycle-importing cron test files pass (1409 tests) through scripts/run_tests.sh -j 1. Preserve parameter/backtick boundaries and normalize ANSI-C strings only for POSIX tokenization.
